# Moddy Arena: a make aimed OUTSIDE the place (at the ground far below it, standing there) is refused by the reach
# rule: a wish lands only inside the room he stands in, the arena or the prep room, and nothing is built.
@intent a player outside the arena and its prep room aims a make at the ground there, and it is refused
@world flat seed=1

@step arrive
@expect chat Welcome to Moddy Arena within 90s
@wait 2s

@step outside the place
# the flat world's ground, far below and away from the place, looking down at the grass in front of him
# SHORTCUT: he is put on the ground outside the place (getting out of it is not what the step tests)
tp @s 40 -60 0 90 0
@aim look 90 40
@wait 2s
@assert execute at @s if block ~ ~-1 ~ minecraft:grass_block
@shot aiming-outside

@step the Apprentice offers a house
moddy apprentice a cozy house
@expect screen Container within 10s

@step he presses the top tile and it is refused
@click slot 0
@expect chat /didn't work this time/ within 90s
@wait 2s
# nothing stands on the ground round him (compared with the empty sky at y 200)
@assert execute if blocks 20 -60 -15 39 -50 15 20 200 -15 all
@shot refused
